{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-work-wp-portfolio-slug-jsx","path":"/work/conservation-capital/","result":{"data":{"wpPortfolio":{"title":"CONSERVATION CAPITAL","content":"<p>I designed a new website for Conservation Capital in Winter 2021. This is focused around a comprehensive set of the organisation’s projects (case-studies) which are stylishly displayed in various forms across the site. The website was built as a Headless WordPress website using GatsbyJS and hosted on Netlify, which provides much higher security and performance than a standard WordPress website, whilst providing the client with a simple but powerful WordPress CMS.</p>\n<p>“Paul developed a bespoke responsive website as part of a remote creative team for an international client. During the project Paul was knowledgeable about his craft, prompt to respond and thorough throughout &#8211; he went over and above to ensure the client was happy. Our client is thrilled with the end result. Thank you, Paul!” &#8211; Cath Harris</p>\n","slug":"conservation-capital","url":{"url":"https://www.conservation-capital.com/"},"image1":{"image1":{"mediaDetails":{"sizes":[{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/cc1-300x225.png","width":"300","name":"medium"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/cc1-1024x769.png","width":"1024","name":"large"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/cc1-150x150.png","width":"150","name":"thumbnail"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/cc1-768x577.png","width":"768","name":"medium_large"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/cc1-1200x902.png","width":"1200","name":"post-thumbnail"}]}}},"image2":{"image2":{"mediaDetails":{"sizes":[{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/cc2-300x225.png","width":"300","name":"medium"},{"s